  <item>
    <title>001.INFP和ENFJ真的是默契旅行同伴吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667843c5b6a8412729c374a5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667843c5b6a8412729c374a5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 15:48:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期是INFP和ENFJ去巴厘岛旅行前的问答环节和吐槽大会。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>这次一只烟（INFP）来Stephen（ENFJ）家里终于把我们巴厘岛的行程安排好了，对于这次还为开始的旅行，我们似乎已经有了一些小的摩擦点…</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> Stephen（ENFJ）E人的抓马自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> Q&amp;A问答环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 对于巴厘岛之旅最期待什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 两年前我们第一次旅行的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> J人焦虑P人不做计划哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> INFP的freestyle性格不太顾虑其他人感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 旅行中的边界感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 吐槽环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> Stephen大吐槽我经常失联不回复微信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 我被Stephen 24小时想要跟我密切联系而焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> J人对P人的吐槽旅行计划毫无条理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a> INFP和ENFJ是很默契的组合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> J人喜欢P人看到计划后赞扬的成就感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 为什么选择住青旅</span></p><span></span><p><span>来Stephen家蹭饭，泰式餐的招待，大夸赞Stephen和他男朋友的厨艺</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luqs560zy3VygIMaJB8S7YuZ5r17.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>2022年我们第一次出去玩</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuezbu6kwIKaWnxWc93c7XXF13FM.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Stephen规划的大蝙蝠地图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgfxpUbvKxmaFOMhXU_-nSyTDguf.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>认真的J人让P人很崇拜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fli3es1jMxnkwczf7-PkWyc1PMEl.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎订阅「在逃公主」不定期与你聊聊家常，聊聊我近期发生的开心、讨厌、生气的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>「主播介绍」</span></p><span></span><p><span>一只烟 INFP</span></p><span></span><p><span>自由职业 | 健身教练 | 小红书博主</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54b015ef2e1d9362cda18d7d?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=54b015ef2e1d9362cda18d7d&amp;apptime=1719186983" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54b015ef2e1d9362cda18d7d?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=54b015ef2e1d9362cda18d7d&amp;apptime=1719186983"><span>一只烟</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>向往自由，所以不爱坐班工作，选择当个自由职业者</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱户外 徒步/越野跑/骑行</span></p><span></span><p><span>I人习惯独处，独来独往的孤僻家</span></p><span></span><p><span>但喜欢把事情在媒体上分享给所有人看</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期嘉宾」</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stephen ENFJ</span></p><span></span><p><span>gap year的自由人｜小红书博主</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5f966fff0000000001000bf6?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=54b015ef2e1d9362cda18d7d&amp;apptime=1719186997" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5f966fff0000000001000bf6?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=54b015ef2e1d9362cda18d7d&amp;apptime=1719186997"><span>Stephen Shao</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>关于「在逃公主」</span></p><span></span><p><span>想把播客当诉说站在播客让大家更了解我，也想想讲述普通人对自由生活的心态想法，通过播客的方式去了解自己的生活和朋友的生活。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmO3lYCrPdYaTER2P2jC9OznYVWi.m4a" length="48771926" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:28:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkuLYH7oDFu3C5WnoVR8wrGEgXq-.jpg"/>
